children":"The caveat is specific to this market and worth taking seriously. Government tenders often specify the permitted entity type, and a good number require audited accounts and turnover history for several past years. Check the eligibility clause of the tenders you actually intend to bid for before choosing. An LLP formed this month cannot produce three years of audited accounts any more than a company can."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"href":"#enquiry","className":"brand-gradient inline-flex min-h-[3.25rem] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-7 font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-soft","children":["Talk to an Expert",["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/services/llp-registration/","className":"inline-flex min-h-[3.25rem] items-center justify-center rounded-xl border-2 border-primary px-7 font-semibold text-primary transition-colors hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground","children":["Full ","LLP"," guide"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground","children":"At a glance"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm","children":[["$","div","Structure",{"className":"border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-4","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-secondary","children":"Structure"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"LLP"}]]}],"$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L