32:["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary","children":"Local considerations"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] lg:leading-tight","children":"What is worth checking in Gandhinagar"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"These are the points that actually differ by market, rather than the general features of the structure."}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-border md:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","li","Confirm the tender accepts an LLP",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Confirm the tender accepts an LLP"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Many Gujarat government tenders permit a company or an LLP, and where both are allowed the LLP is cheaper to run. Some specify a company. Some require audited accounts and turnover for a number of past years, which no new entity of any kind can satisfy. Read the eligibility clause of the specific tenders you intend to bid for before you register."}]]}],["$","li","The LLP Agreement should handle how work is won and delivered",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"The LLP Agreement should handle how work is won and delivered"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"In a Gandhinagar consultancy the partners' contributions are usually unequal in kind: one holds the client and tender relationships, another delivers. The LLP Agreement is where profit shares, authority to sign and submit bids, and what happens if the partner who wins the work leaves are settled. It must be filed in Form 3 within thirty days of incorporation."}]]}],["$","li","Audit above thresholds, and tenders may want it anyway",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Audit above thresholds, and tenders may want it anyway"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"An LLP needs audit only once turnover exceeds Rs 40 lakh or contribution exceeds Rs 25 lakh. That is a genuine saving, but if you intend to bid for government work that asks for audited accounts, you may want audited accounts regardless of whether the LLP Act requires them. Worth deciding deliberately rather than discovering at bid time."}]]}],["$","li","GIFT City is a different question entirely",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"04"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"GIFT City is a different question entirely"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"If the intention is to operate inside the IFSC at GIFT City, the structure has to be planned around IFSC authorisation requirements administered by the IFSCA, not just around incorporation. Do not assume an LLP formed in the ordinary way is a route into IFSC activity. That needs specialist advice on the IFSC side first."}]]}]]}]]}]}]
